# Pages rendered in the browser get the empty page that loads the site (dist/app-shell.html, written
# by scripts/prerender.mjs). One rule per address: Cloudflare checks these before real files, so a
# catch-all here would capture every file too. Every other address with no file of its own gets
# dist/404.html with a 404 status: the homepage, marked noindex, which is also what the app shows
# for an unknown address. Keep in step with the routes in app.jsx (npm run check:seo checks): a page
# missing here would answer 404.
# Partner pages (getpoolnautics.com/with/<handle>, partnerProgram.js) aren't built yet: the homepage.
/reserve          /app-shell   200
/reserve/         /app-shell   200
# The repairs and work orders page moved from /request-flow (Nov 11–12, 2026) to /workflow, for good.
/request-flow     /workflow    301
/request-flow/    /workflow    301
# The previous homepage (/landing) is gone: an old link goes home, for good.
/with/*          /            200
/landing          /            301
/landing/         /            301
